		{"id":"c8e4a15355e56bc1","type":"text","text":"He knows all, from his words. But refuses to believe that the Ran'tal are still alive somewhere.","x":1920,"y":-598,"width":359,"height":105,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"818bc0cbd80c5d4c","type":"text","text":"Saying before it fizzled away: \"YOUR TITANS WILL NOT SAVE YOU UNLIKE _LAST_ TIME, THE LIGHT, THE DARK, THE INBETWEEN- THEY WILL NOT SAVE YOU AS THEY DID IN ANCIENT TIMES. YOU WILL ALL DIE AND DIE, YOUR CIVILIZATION WILL BE WIPED OUT AND WE THE CRIMSON LEGION WILL RETURN\"","x":2480,"y":-622,"width":601,"height":153,"color":"1"},
